    "detailed_description": "is a Magic Tower (fixed-value strategy RPG) game with additional elements such as Skills and Equipment, in which players take on the role of different Braves to go to the Magic-Tower and defeat the Demon King to &quot;save&quot; their world!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821570/extras/9d32255f1734a98fbc34f6511fd3e24c.poster.avif?t=1678360727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821570/extras/9d32255f1734a98fbc34f6511fd3e24c.webm?t=1678360727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821570/extras/9d32255f1734a98fbc34f6511fd3e24c.mp4?t=1678360727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2>- Play Gutsy Swordsman for free! After succeeding in the High Challenge, you will also be rewarded with free unlockable [paid DLC] to play other characters!<br>- 6 different characters, learn a variety of skills in the Tower<br>- 53 levels of carefully designed towers, a structure that changes depending on the character, and different character plots to uncover the nature of the tower as the game unfolds<br>- Use different characters to explore the hidden mystery of the tower, use different weapons and equipment, and create your own way through.<br>- The carefully balanced 3 basic difficulties + 100 additional difficulty challenges allow both casual and hardcore players to enjoy the strategy of this game.<br>- Each character has more than 2 hours of single pass time to start your strategy feast.<br>- After raiding the tower, challenge the extremely difficult mode, maybe you are the next number one in the world in the leaderboard.<br>- Redrawing of the classic magic tower monsters, more than 60 kinds of enemies, master the enemy skills, defeat the lord and the last demon king, to create their own adventure!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821570/extras/a0f1bb59a6825043e7cea0860bb2aee2.poster.avif?t=1678360727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821570/extras/a0f1bb59a6825043e7cea0860bb2aee2.webm?t=1678360727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821570/extras/a0f1bb59a6825043e7cea0860bb2aee2.mp4?t=1678360727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't miss out on such a fun free game. What are you waiting for?  </h2>",
